# Repository text policy: check out text files with LF on every platform.
#
# Compiler acceptance tests read Skill fixtures and contracts as raw bytes and
# perform exact string replacement / digest checks on them. A CRLF working tree
# (the default with core.autocrlf=true on Windows) would silently change those
# test inputs and make local acceptance results platform-dependent. Git stores
# these files as LF already; this attribute keeps the checkout identical too.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary payloads must never be converted.
*.wasm binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.exe binary
*.pdf binary
